  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I was hanging out with a crowd of people in a newly public room of mine, and someone wondered if they could kick me from my own room, so I figured we might as well test it.\n\nI'm not sure if this qualifies as a bug, but people are able to vote kick the room author out of their own room. \n\nWhile there may be fringe cases where a room author deserves to be kicked, I think in those cases a moderator should be alerted, and the room author should not be able to be kicked from their own room due to potential abuses of that power, especially by raids.\n\nThanks for considering this report!\n\n- With love, The Architect",
